id: pmc-q22j
title: This package generates its own changelog without the flag that stops the heading date coming from the clock
description: "pm-changelog synthesises a pending release window for a version with no matching git tag and stamps it with the current UTC date. Its own changelog scripts and release workflow did not pass the date-from-version flag, the one this package itself ships for exactly that case, so its changelog check regenerates a different heading date every day and fails on any day after the changelog was written. Applied the flag to every invocation of the generator here: two sites in package.json and one in the release workflow."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: changelog,gates,release
created_at: "2026-08-24T09:42:16.204Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T10:29:41.612Z"
deadline: "2026-08-31T00:00:00.000Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T19:07:15.236Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T19:07:15.236Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: "Every invocation of the generator in this package passes the flag, and changelog check passes on a day other than the version's own calendar date"
resolution: "Rechecked main ff1418fff98b4409421053a44e46e488f11daa64: Commits 0f7cd3b426313fb97613311fb32115a79721cc72 and 99d58799f38fd271b285bc9a3a86ac6f5b5826df delivered --date-from-version on self-generation and workflow delegation to the same npm scripts. PR #247 added a real-tracker integration regression for the existing fix. Retained evidence: package.json (changelog:full/release:notes), .github/workflows/release.yml, test/release-backlog.test.ts, scripts/verify-release-changelog-date.ts, test/verify-release-changelog-date.test.ts, docs/backlog-verification.md."
expected_result: The same untagged package version produces the same changelog heading date independently of the wall clock.
actual_result: "Rechecked main ff1418fff98b4409421053a44e46e488f11daa64: Commits 0f7cd3b426313fb97613311fb32115a79721cc72 and 99d58799f38fd271b285bc9a3a86ac6f5b5826df delivered --date-from-version on self-generation and workflow delegation to the same npm scripts. PR #247 added a real-tracker integration regression for the existing fix. Retained evidence: package.json (changelog:full/release:notes), .github/workflows/release.yml, test/release-backlog.test.ts, scripts/verify-release-changelog-date.ts, test/verify-release-changelog-date.test.ts, docs/backlog-verification.md."
