close_reason: "Rechecked main ff1418fff98b4409421053a44e46e488f11daa64: Commits 0f7cd3b426313fb97613311fb32115a79721cc72 and 99d58799f38fd271b285bc9a3a86ac6f5b5826df delivered --date-from-version on self-generation and workflow delegation to the same npm scripts. PR #247 added a real-tracker integration regression for the existing fix. Retained evidence: package.json (changelog:full/release:notes), .github/workflows/release.yml, test/release-backlog.test.ts, scripts/verify-release-changelog-date.ts, test/verify-release-changelog-date.test.ts, docs/backlog-verification.md."
body: "The release workflow tags only after npm publish succeeds. Publish has failed fleet wide since 2026-08-21, so this package carries an untagged version and sits on the clock dependent path its own flag exists to remove."
